\par\par \b \uc2  OPTIONS -  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  wariness underpins yen vols. \b0\par\par\uc2 433 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 April 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, April 20 (Reuters) - Concern that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  anew to stem yen weakness kept implied volatilities for dollar/yen options bolstered despite the imminence of Japan's Golden Week holidays. \par \par \uc2  Speculation that the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could sell dollars for yen, as it did just over a week ago, prevented spot from extending gains beyond Monday's one-and-a-half-week high of 132.44. \par \par \uc2  Wariness of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to persist before the Japanese government announces on Friday details of an economic stimulus package worth 16 trillion yen which it has already outlined, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The Japanese authorities keep saying the yen is too weak but the market keeps ruthlessly taking it lower and this is just setting the stage for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Gerome Bono, London head of \b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2  options at Credit Suisse. \par \par \uc2  Implied volatility for one-month options was at 13.45/13.85 percent against 13.40/13.70 percent at the close of European trading on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Further out along the options curve, six-month and one-year vols edged up by about a tenth of a percentage point each to 13.40/13.70 percent and 13.40/13.55 percent respectively. \par \par \uc2  Risk reversals for one-month 25-delta options were skewed towards yen calls with a bias of 0.35/0.65 compared with their 0.4/0.6 bias late in Europe on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Traders who were caught off-guard by the 4.7 percent slump in dollar/yen in the wake of the most recent bout of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are wary of another such sharp spike lower. \par \par \uc2  But even if the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  again, traders do not expect it will succeed in driving spot dollar sustainably below 125 yen, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "People need gamma and in the short-term downside yen calls are favoured, but in the medium-term, people think yen weakness is inevitable," said an options trader at a bank in London. \par \par \uc2  Such expectations were reinforced after Bank of Japan Governor Masaru Hayami repeated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's view that the economy was stagnant with strong downward pressure on overall economic activity. \par \par \uc2  Concern that the economy is heading into a deflationary spiral was also fanned after a report showed the domestic wholesale price index for the first 10 days of April fell 2.1 percent from the same period a year earlier. Meantime, import prices fell 7.4 percent. ((Swaha Pattanaik, London newsroom, +44 171 542 6284, uk.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 .news@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du4k071fe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
