\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Options: Yen Volatilities Down As Dlr's Rise Limited \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 April 1998\par 06:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Volatilities implied by yen \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  options are lower in Tokyo Friday compared with their levels in New York late Thursday, as the dollar's upside was capped around Y132.00 because of lingering fears of dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market. \par \par \uc2  Fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened a little compared with Thursday, when the meeting of finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors of the Group of Seven countries expressed support for the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week to bolster that weak yen. \par \par \uc2  However, as the dollar moved higher toward Y132.00, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears re-emerged and the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  met substantial selling by U.S. hedge funds and interbank traders, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'There may not be a concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but we are still wary about a BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at that level,' said a trader at a Japanese city bank. 'With the dollar's upside limited, options trading has become less active and volatile.' \par \par \uc2  In the over-the-counter market, one-month at-the-money dollar/yen options imply volatility of 13.4% bid, down from 13.8% in New York Thursday, and below 13.6% in Tokyo Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Against the mark, they are lower at 9.0% from 9.1% in New York Thursday. Dollar/mark options were quoted at 9.0% in Tokyo Thursday. 'Because the dollar got back to the DEM1.8000-level, consistent with the market's mid-term sentiment, volatilities eased,' said a trader at a Japanese trust bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0400 GMT, the dollar is at Y132.08 and DEM1.8077, up from Y131.80 and DEM1.8045 late Thursday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Risk-reversals favor dollar put options against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. Risk-reversals measure the market preference for either put or call options by the premium or discount applied. \par \par \uc2  -By Takeshi Takeuchi;813-5255-2934; ttakeuchi@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0424GMT \par \par \uc2  1077 4127 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4h037yx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
