rong demand by Japanese institutional investors and importers to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on dips is also expected to make any dollar falls short-lived, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Even during Wednesday's session, 'among Japanese players, there is strong dollar-buying demand,' Mitsubishi Trust's Kurosawa said. \par \par \uc2  And with Japan's Y16 trillion economic stimulus package likely to be one focus of the G-7 meeting, if Japan's G-7 partners suggest the plan is inadequate, the yen may be sold on increased pessimism about Japan's economy, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'It's hard to tell whether the recent package has satisfied other countries. If Japan is required to take further (economic) steps, the dollar is likely to rise back to near Y135.00,' said Yukihiko Hashimoto, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Sanwa Bank. \par \par \uc2  The mark is quoted at Y71.76, down from Y71.96 in New York Tuesday but above Y71.66 in London Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Sterling is at $1.6849, down slightly from $1.6850 in New York late Tuesday. Sterling was at $1.6842 in London late Tuesday. o DIW0546 diwin 212 04-15 06:39 ----- un djtgv ccc apemr ttt tks tok dj File Not Found djtgv ccc apemr ttt tks tok \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par djkdmnklmdb#\par Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Roundup -3: Dlr Falls To Near 2-Mo Low Vs MarkDIW0516  diwin\par    389 04-15 06:25   ----- un djtgv djkdmnklmdb# Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  djtgv\par djkdmnklmdb#\par Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Roundup -2: Fears Of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  After G-7DIW0514  diwin\par 411 04-15 06:25   USING un djtgv ccc apemr djaer ttt tks djtgv ccc\par apemr djaer ttt tks tok\par djkdmnklmdb#\par Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Roundup -2: Fears Of \f2