\par\par \b \uc2  Japan, U.S. stop short of saying joint yen action. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Yoshiko Mori \par \uc2 478 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 April 1998\par 22:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON, April 15 (Reuters) - Japan and the United States stopped short on Wednesday of suggesting joint action to bolster the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although they said they shared concern over the yen's steep decline. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Hikaru Matsunaga and Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin voiced concern about the recent yen weakness after meeting on Wednesday ahead of a meeting of finance ministers and central bankers from the Group of Seven (G7) major industrialized countries. \par \par \uc2  But a Japanese government official said that "there was no such reference during the meeting" to possible joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The official, briefing reporters after the meeting, added that it was inappropriate to comment further on the issue. \par \par \uc2  Matsunaga also stopped short of a clear reference to joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the meeting with Rubin. \par \par \uc2  "We have reconfirmed that we will continue to closely cooperate in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as needed," Matsunaga said. \par \par \uc2  Asked if there might be a link between joint \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  action and Japanese efforts to stimulate the economy, Rubin said:"No." \par \par \uc2  Japan has just announced a huge package to stimulate its economy. \par \par \uc2  The United States has welcomed the package, but made clear that early implementation was needed. \par \par \uc2  Rubin reaffirmed that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  was on the agenda of the G7 talks, but offered no guidance on what direction the discussion might take. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets have been edgy on speculation that members of the G7 - Britain, Canada, France, Germany, Italy, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the United States - might agree on coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bolster the value of the yen. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) sent the dollar tumbling more than 4.5 percent in just two trading days with its forceful attempt to defend the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders estimated that the BOJ spent more than $10 billion to shore up the yen. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was followed by news that the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $12 billion worth of U.S. Treasury bills to raise cash for the settlement of the dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  Japanese monetary authorities have recently been advocating that a strong yen was in the national interest. \par \par \uc2  BOJ Governor Masaru Hayami said on Monday that the weak yen was not just boosting Japan's trade surplus, but eroding the purchasing power of Japan's businesses and consumers and that a consequent fall in demand could prolong the recovery of Asia's troubled economies. \par \par \uc2  Matsunaga said after the BOJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in New York on Thursday; "The recent depreciation of the yen raises serious concern in view of the need for avoiding exacerbation of large external imbalances, and cannot be justified given Japan's potential economic strength." \par \par \uc2  Rubin said in a statement after the BOJ's move that he welcomed the bank's action to support the value of the yen. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du4f07are\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
