\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Keeps Yen At Forefront For April 15 G-7 \b0\par\par\uc2  By Uta Harnischfeger \par \uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 April 1998\par 18:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  FRANKFURT (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the yen late last week gives the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  automatic top-billing at the Group of Seven Industrialized Nations' meeting in Washington on April 15, analysts and officials say. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last Thursday and Friday, carried out in part by the Federal Reserve Of New York, highlighted the dilemma facing policy-makers: On one hand a weak yen will bolster Japan's feeble economy, but on the other, it's a time bomb for U.S.-Japanese trade relations, with the potential to heighten existing trade tensions between the two countries. \par \par \uc2  Many market watchers expect world monetary officials to place growing trade imbalances in second place to the international community's wish to prop up Japan's economy. \par \par \uc2  Accordingly they expect relatively soft language on dollar-yen levels to emerge from the meetings in Washington this week. \par \par \uc2  Most don't expect anything but verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to emerge from the meeting of G-7 finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors. They say the G-7 feels that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economy isn't quite ripe to support coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  yet. \par \par \uc2  'Coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still off the table at Wednesday's G-7 meeting,' said David Gilmore, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Analytics in New York. \par \par \uc2  '(U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert) Rubin's strong dollar credentials are intact, and Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't mark a shift U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy,' added Gilmore. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 13-04-98 \par \par \uc2  1638GMT \par \par \uc2  1192 4211 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4d03293\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
