\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday:Dlr Drops Vs Yen But  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Discounted \b0\par\par\uc2 355 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 April 1998\par 04:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The dollar dropped half a yen in late morning trading Friday, as investors still wary after Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  around Y131.00. The dollar is also lower against the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  But the dollar's fall to an intraday low of Y130.50 around 0215 GMT (10:15 p.m. EST) wasn't due to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although some rumors to that effect moved through the market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'The quick movement down certainly could be attributed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the size of the move was really limited,' said a trader at a Japanese bank. 'This wasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , just nervousness.' \par \par \uc2  'The dollar did drop quite sharply, but there was no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' added another Japanese bank dealer. 'Some large Japanese banks just placed some large orders (to sell the dollar).' \par \par \uc2  Market participants said the dollar should find initial support at Y130.50, where some institutional investors have buy orders. Below that, the support at Y129.80 is more solid. \par \par \uc2  Given the thin market overseas ahead of the Easter weekend, any large order is likely to have a larger impact than usual. And the threat of BOJ action remains, given the four yen plunge Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , acting through the Federal Reserve Bank of New York, spent more than $1 billion to support the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'The market can't rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , of course,' the Japanese bank trader said. 'And unlike yesterday, they won't announce it in Tokyo time, they'll just do it.' \par \par \uc2  Around 0215 GMT, the dollar is trading at an intraday low of Y130.50, down from Y130.98 around 0030 GMT and below Y131.20 in New York late Thursday. The dollar was quoted at Y131.58 in Tokyo late Thursday. It is also trading at DEM1.8200, lower than DEM1.8235 earlier in Tokyo and below DEM1.8235 late Thursday in New York. The dollar was at DEM1.8145 in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 10-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0224GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4a031uh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
