\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  EPA Omi/BOJ Hayami -3: \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Done In 3 Actions \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 April 1998\par 03:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Omi said that the negative sentiment among households and business executives is now affecting the overall economy of the nation. \par \par \uc2  The EPA said in its monthly economic report released earlier Friday that the economy, stagnant due to weak household spending, falling corporate earnings and flagging capital investment, has showed signs of increasing severity recently. \par \par \uc2  To put the economy on recovery track, Hashimoto announced on Thursday a Y16 trillion economic stimulus package that will include Y10 trillion of actual spending that includes public works projects and tax cuts. \par \par \uc2  Omi reiterated Hashimoto's pledge to debate revisions to a deficit-reduction program, in order to implement the stimulus plan. \par \par \uc2  'We will change the fiscal reform law as necessary to implement the economic package,' Omi said. He added that the details of the plan will be released the week beginning Monday, April 20. \par \par \uc2  Separately, an EPA official briefing reporters on the cabinet meeting earlier, said that Bank of Japan Governor Masaru Hayami informed Hashimoto of the details regarding the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the Federal Reserve Bank of New York Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Hayami informed Hashimoto that the dollar fell from the mid-Y133 level to the mid-Y129 level in New York following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, noting that the dollar subsequently recovered to the Y131 level, Hayami said he would 'carefully watch today's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market,' the EPA quoted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor as saying. \par \par \uc2  Hayami added that Japanese monetary authorities had discussed the situation with U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin, the EPA official said. \par \par \uc2  Hayami was also quoted by Nikkei News as saying that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  overnight was 'sizable' and was done in three separate actions. \par \par \uc2  At 0130 GMT, the dollar is trading at Y131.30, up slightly from around Y131.20 in late Thursday in New York. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0142GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4a031t9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
