\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr drops more than 4 yen in Tokyo on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 April 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, April 10 (Reuters) - The dollar dropped more than four yen in Tokyo trade on Friday due to aggressive dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ), bankers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell toward 127.00 yen from a Tokyo high for the day of 131.55 yen, after what bankers said were persistent bouts of dollar for yen sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  from late morning. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was quoted at 128.00/10 yen at 0615 GMT, sharply down from 130.02/12 yen in late New York on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said the BOJ's dollar sales in Tokyo were aimed at backing up its action taken in New York on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  BOJ Governor Masaru Hayami was quoted by an EPA official earlier on Friday as saying that the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market three times on Thursday in New York, buying yen for dollars. \par \par \uc2  But the sales in Tokyo were supposed to have been done secretly in order to maximise the impact on the market, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  "Today's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during Tokyo time was meant to be secret, unlike the one we saw in December immediately after Prime Minister (Ryutaro) Hashimoto's surprising announcement of the two trillion yen income tax cut for 1998/99," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  On December 17, Japanese monetary authorities admitted they conducted dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  soon after the Tokyo market detected it, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  The authorities have refrained from commenting on the BOJ's apparent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Tokyo on Friday. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 8570 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du4a07jhp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
