\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ/Slowing Yen's Fall -3: Cool Reaction To Tax Cuts \b0\par\par\uc2 333 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 1998\par 19:57\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "I wouldn't look for that much lasting impact out of\par this," said Andrew Hodge, vice president, financial\par strategist at Bank Brussels Lambert. The BOJ action will\par merely result in a slowing of the yen's decline, he said.\par    For Thursday, however, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  should take\par pressure off the yen, as the dollar selling for yen cleared\par out long dollar positions, or bets the dollar will rise\par against the yen.\par    Bank Brussels Lambert sold $10 million in around 10\par seconds when bond traders on their proprietary trading desk\par got wind of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Hodge said. "We just managed\par to get out by the skin of our teeth,"\par    The BOJ's timing was well chosen.\par    After a negative reaction to Hashimoto's package, the\par Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to send a message and in a\par way that would maximize the effectiveness of the move.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "There are only a couple of times when Japan is in (the\par market) and the rest of the world is out," said David\par Durrant, a global \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at IDEA in New York.\par "Easter is one of those times."\par    Some saw the move as a tacit admission by the Japanese\par that the tax cut announcement - which the U.S. had advocated\par - failed to achieve its intended purpose.\par    Frustration, in other words, was likely a factor in the\par BOJ decision, which drove home the government's commitment\par to reform, said Bob Lynch, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist with\par Banque Paribas in New York.\par    The Japanese "have to make this statement, to show they\par are trying to do something, that they've introduced tax\par cuts, that they're \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the yen," Lynch\par said. "They're saying: 'Stick with us, we are trying to do\par the best we can.'"\par    To be sure, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  doesn't in itself alter\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's unattractive fundamentals, which the yen's price\par will ultimately reflect, said Lynch.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  04-09-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1357EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1148 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du4900wx3\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (japan near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\